"Themes available: %ld. The clock shows local macOS time. Minimalism and Minimalism 24 are original 12- and 24-hour themes in light and dark variants. The default is Minimalism 24 — Dark; your saved selection takes priority. Manufacturer themes are in Theme → Raketa, with the dial scale and hand direction of each model.\n\nDrag the clock to move it. Click to switch between the dial and the full watch with bezel and strap. All Minimalism variants include a case and matte strap.\n\nLeft-click the menu bar icon to toggle Always on top; a dot indicates that it is enabled. Right-click or Control-click the icon or clock for settings: theme, size, position lock, seconds hand, and launch at login.\n\nLaunch at login starts the app after you sign in. Move the app to Applications first. If macOS requests approval, open General → Login Items." = "Themes available: %ld. The clock shows local macOS time. Minimalism and Minimalism 24 are original 12- and 24-hour themes in light and dark variants. The default is Minimalism 24 — Dark; your saved selection takes priority. Manufacturer themes are in Theme → Raketa, with the dial scale and hand direction of each model.\n\nDrag the clock to move it. Click to switch between the dial and the full watch with bezel and strap. All Minimalism variants include a case and matte strap.\n\nLeft-click the menu bar icon to toggle Always on top; a dot indicates that it is enabled. Right-click or Control-click the icon or clock for settings: theme, size, position lock, seconds hand, and launch at login.\n\nLaunch at login starts the app after you sign in. Move the app to Applications first. If macOS requests approval, open General → Login Items.";
